WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.707
A filtered view introduces an important write
question If the view only

00:00:05.733 --> 00:00:09.944
shows active patients what should happen when an
update through the view sets active to

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:15.639
false Without a check option the row may simply
disappear from the view

00:00:15.652 --> 00:00:21.177
after the update WITH CHECK OPTION can enforce the
view condition for writes

00:00:21.191 --> 00:00:22.401
performed through the view
